	"html": "<main><div role=\"main\" class=\"container main-container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col\"></div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col\"><div class=\"it-content__wrapper\"><div id=\"it-region-content\" class=\"region content\"><div id=\"it-block-italiagov-content\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block\"><div class=\"blocco-societa-trasparente\"><div class=\"title-wrapper\"><a href=\"/en/transparent-company\" class=\"back-societa-trasparente\">BACK</a><h2>Document for year: 2025</h2></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">Controls and reliefs on the administration</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#independent-assessment-bodies-assessment-teams-or-other-bodies-with-similar-functions\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Independent assessment bodies, assessment teams or other bodies with similar functions</div></a></h3><div id=\"independent-assessment-bodies-assessment-teams-or-other-bodies-with-similar-functions\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>On May 31, 2024, the President of the Board of Directors assigned the task of certifying the publication obligations to the Supervisory Body in its collegial composition.</p></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-06/2024%20-Provvedimento%20di%20nomina%20per%20la%20funzione%20di%20OIV_0.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">2024 -Provvedimento di nomina per la funzione di OIV_0.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-06/Griglia%20di%20rilevazione%20al%2011-12-2024_0.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">Griglia di rilevazione al 11-12-2024_0.pdf</a></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">General provisions</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#statute\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Statute</div></a></h3><div id=\"statute\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-06/Statuto%202024.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">Statuto 2024.pdf</a></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">Organization</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#board-of-directors\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Board of Directors</div></a></h3><div id=\"board-of-directors\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><h3>President</h3><ul><li><strong>Biagini Andrea</strong></li><li>email:&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:presidente@gida-spa.it\">presidente@gida-spa.it</a></li><li>Appointment: Data being updated</li><li>Compensation: Data being updated&nbsp;</li></ul><h3>Chief Executive Officer</h3><ul><li><strong>Cristo Franco</strong></li><li>Appointment: Data being updated</li><li>Compensation: Data being updated&nbsp;</li></ul><h3>Board Members</h3><ul><li><strong>Domenicucci Isabella</strong></li><li>Appointment: Data being updated</li><li>Compensation: Data being updated&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Santianni Daniela</strong></li><li>Appointment: Data being updated</li><li>Compensation: Data being updated&nbsp;</li><li><strong>Reali Fabio</strong></li><li>Appointment: Data being updated</li><li>Compensation: Data being updated&nbsp;</li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><div class=\"no-genitore\">Calls for tenders and contracts</div></h3><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>No tender procedures are currently underway.</p><p>Pursuant to Article 23 of Legislative Decree 36/2023, the link to the BDNCP is published below:</p><p><a href=\"https://pubblicitalegale.anticorruzione.it/bdncp\">https://pubblicitalegale.anticorruzione.it/bdncp</a></p></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><div class=\"no-genitore\">Information on individual procedures</div></h3><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>The publication of data pursuant to Article 1, paragraph 32, of Law 190/2012, relating to December 31, 2023, is available in the archive. Information for the year 2024 will be published by January 31, 2025, if required.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">Grants, contributions, subsidies, economic benefits</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#criteria-and-procedures\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Criteria and procedures</div></a></h3><div id=\"criteria-and-procedures\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-06/1.%20Fac%20Simile%20Autocertificazione.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">1. Fac Simile Autocertificazione.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-06/2.%20Modalit%C3%A0%20operative%20per%20la%20richiesta%20di%20sponsorizzazioni%20e%20vantaggi%20economici.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">2. Modalità operative per la richiesta di sponsorizzazioni e vantaggi economici.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-06/3.%20Proc%20donazioni%20e%20sponsorizzazioni.%20f.to%20in%20originale.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">3. Proc donazioni e sponsorizzazioni. f.to in originale.pdf</a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#list-of-sponsorships---donations\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>List of sponsorships / donations</div></a></h3><div id=\"list-of-sponsorships---donations\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>As of May 27, 2024, there have been no acts of granting subsidies, contributions, financial aids, or any economic advantages of any kind to individuals and public or private entities exceeding one thousand euros.</p></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-06/FILE%20SPONSORIZZAZIONI%20A%20MAGGIO%202024.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">FILE SPONSORIZZAZIONI A MAGGIO 2024.pdf</a></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#approved-financial-statements\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>APPROVED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS</div></a></h3><div id=\"approved-financial-statements\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>For the financial statements of previous years, please refer to the \"Archive\" section.</p>&nbsp;\n&nbsp;<p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2026-08/GIDA%202025_Relazione%20Separato_firma%20socio%20FB_pubb_on-line_0.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">GIDA 2025_Relazione Separato_firma socio FB_pubb_on-line_0.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2026-08/GIDA%20SpA_bilancio_2025_pubb_on-line_0.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">GIDA SpA_bilancio_2025_pubb_on-line_0.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2026-08/GIDA%20SpA_Relazione_collegio_sindacale_pubb-on-line_0.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">GIDA SpA_Relazione_collegio_sindacale_pubb-on-line_0.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2026-08/GIDA%20SpA_Relazione_sulla_gestione_2025_pubb_on-line_0.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">GIDA SpA_Relazione_sulla_gestione_2025_pubb_on-line_0.pdf</a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#administrative-measures\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Administrative measures</div></a></h3><div id=\"administrative-measures\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><ul><li><p>The company is not subject to measures from the public administration (PA) shareholder that set specific, annual, and multi-year objectives regarding the overall operating expenses.</p></li><li><p>Consequently, the company has no obligation in relation to the achievement of the specific, annual, and multi-year objectives regarding the overall operating expenses set by the PA shareholder.</p></li></ul></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">Services provided</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#service-charter-and-quality-standards\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Service Charter and Quality Standards</div></a></h3><div id=\"service-charter-and-quality-standards\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>The document published is the one in force as of October 06, 2025.</p></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-11/Carta%20dei%20Servizi_GIDA-Rev8_del_06.10.2025_0.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">Carta dei Servizi_GIDA-Rev8_del_06.10.2025_0.pdf</a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#class-action\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Class Action</div></a></h3><div id=\"class-action\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>There are no appeals filed by holders of legally relevant and homogeneous interests as of May 27, 2024.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#costs-accounted\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>costs accounted</div></a></h3><div id=\"costs-accounted\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-06/Costi%20Contabilizzati%20art.%2032%20D.%20Lgs.%2033-2013.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">Costi Contabilizzati art. 32 D. Lgs. 33-2013.pdf</a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#waiting-lists\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Waiting lists</div></a></h3><div id=\"waiting-lists\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>It applies exclusively to entities, companies, and private structures that provide services on behalf of the National Health Service (SSN).</p></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#network-services\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Network Services</div></a></h3><div id=\"network-services\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>It does not apply as G.I.D.A is not a company fully owned by public entities or with predominant public capital, included in the consolidated financial statement of the public administration as identified by ISTAT.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"wrapper-societa-single\"><div class=\"genitore\">Other contents</div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#whistleblowing\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Whistleblowing</div></a></h3><div id=\"whistleblowing\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>In the system, it is possible to quickly and easily report actual or suspected conduct that may have a negative impact on the integrity of the company and/or individuals in the workplace.</p><p>Access it via the link below:</p><p><a href=\"https://gida-spa.integrityline.com/\">Whistleblowing</a></p></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-06/2024%20-%20REGOLAMENTO%20WHISTLEBLOWING%20Rev%2029-11-2023.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">2024 - REGOLAMENTO WHISTLEBLOWING Rev 29-11-2023.pdf</a></span></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#mog-231-01\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>MOG 231-01</div></a></h3><div id=\"mog-231-01\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p><a href=\"/mog-231-01\">Mog 231 01</a></p></div></div></div><div class=\"box-categoria-societa\"><h3><a data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#civic-access\" class=\"\" aria-expanded=\"true\"><div>Civic Access</div></a></h3><div id=\"civic-access\" class=\"collapse child\"><div class=\"clearfix text-formatted field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Subject to whom the request should be submitted:</p><p>President Of the Board of Directors: Brogi Alessandro :&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:gida@pec.uipservizi.it\">gida@pec.uipservizi.it</a>&nbsp;TEL. &nbsp;+39 -0574-646511.</p><p>Holder of substitute authority in case of delay or lack of response:</p><p>Coordinator of Administration, Finance, and Control: Stefani Marzia :&nbsp;<a href=\"mailto:gida@pec.uipservizi.it\">gida@pec.uipservizi.it</a>&nbsp;TEL.&nbsp;+39 -0574-646511</p><p>The above indications apply both to simple civic access and to generalized civic access.</p></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-06/2024%20MODALITA%27%20OPERATIVE.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">2024 MODALITA' OPERATIVE.pdf</a></span></div><div class=\"field field--name-field-documento-societa-traspare field--type-file field--label-hidden field__item\"><span class=\"file file--mime-application-pdf file--application-pdf\"> <a href=\"/sites/default/files/2025-06/2024%20REGISTRO%20ACCESSI%20I%5E%20SEMESTRE.pdf\" type=\"application/pdf\">2024 REGISTRO ACCESSI I^ SEMESTRE.pdf</a></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div> </main>"
}